OL,3,GNEWSAControversial plans for Devon
OL,4,Acouncils withdrawn
OL,5,
OL,6,FControversial plans to replace Devon's
OL,7,Flocal authorities with four new
OL,8,Fcouncils have been withdrawn by the
OL,9,Fgovernment.
OL,11,FThe plans announced in July proposed an
OL,12,Fenlarged Plymouth, Exeter and Torbay
OL,13,Fwith a fourth council covering the rest
OL,14,Fof rural Devon.
OL,16,FEarlier this autumn ministers announced
OL,17,Fthe plans had been "paused" pending a
OL,18,Freview.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
