OL,3,GNEWSAControversial plans for Devon
OL,4,Acouncils withdrawn
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal Government Minister Jim McMahon
OL,7,Fpromised Devon, along with all the
OL,8,Fother areas under review, would have a
OL,9,Fnew set of proposals by early next
OL,10,Fyear.
